# Agent Execution Pitfalls

This note records recurring execution mistakes and investigation traps discovered during real work.

## Planning And Context Discipline

- Do not restart a continuing task with a broad repo sweep when the active blocker is already documented.
- Do not leave durable decisions only in chat.

## Tooling And Validation Hygiene

- Prefer the narrowest reproducer before broad reruns.
- Keep passing output out of the working context.
